==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Archbaron Face]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 76.67~83.33 seconds<sup>2,300f~2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While this stage may appear scary, Big Baron Face's supports are extremely limited. Additionally, they can all be killed in the exact same way: with [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] alongside [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], whilst controlling them with a combination of [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Rangers]] and [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]]. Once you take care of Archbaron Face's harem, you can kill him with the aforementioned units, or utilize other anti-Floating/Red like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]]/[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to do it even faster.

